// Exact cache-budgeted layout planner.
//
// For every version the planner minimises the published scalarised pair
//   work * 2^16 + image_pages
// which is exactly lexicographic (minimum work, then minimum pages) because
// every legal request stays far below 2^16 total pages.  The interval dynamic
// program carries the resident-page budget so that tree topology, node
// encoding and residency are chosen jointly, and the per-case budget is then
// shared across all immutable versions by a small knapsack.
